    "description": "<p>You call up a dense cloud of vapor to obscure your enemy's vision.</p><p>Choose a point within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. Each creature within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of that point has <strong>Total Cover</strong> against any creature that is not adjacent to it. Creatures at opposite ends of the mist have <strong>Total Cover</strong> against each other.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p>",
